{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんなーこ(*⌒▽⌒*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"山形では今、桜が満開です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まろん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN3W96P5E5Y4H6P3XJQH07Y","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nと、桜の花びら。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"山形の桜みたいです!\nできれば、屋台のでてるところにいきたいなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食べるとしたら、絶対おだんご―○○○―"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、雨が降って散り始めてるみたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"山形には色んなところで桜が見れます。\n歩いていれば多分見れます。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN3WATRYQFMSV744JFYHFZD","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ、山形の桜見に行ってみてください(((o(*ﾟ▽ﾟ*)o)))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京より空いていて、ゆっくり見れますよ～。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⊿長沢菜々香⊿"}],"source":"archive"}